  "notes": "Official cause code was TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; narrative describes a component-defect/incorrect-part cause but per rule 4 the official code governs category, so cause node kept provisional. Discovery was retrospective (root cause interviews and later physical investigation on Aug 7, 2024 and analysis on Apr 3, 2025) rather than a single discrete inspection event, but discovery_context field from form is 'inspection' and copied verbatim. No previous similar events per narrative, so no SIMILAR_TO/stub LER emitted. LPCI Loop Select Logic design is described as the mechanism connecting single valve failure to both-subsystem inoperability; not modeled as a separate System node since it's a design/logic characteristic, not an equipment system participating independently."
